WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Neuroformer is a multimodal,

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:05.916
multitask generative pretrained transformer for
brain data,

00:00:05.996 --> 00:00:07.707
built at UC Santa Barbara.

00:00:07.787 --> 00:00:13.979
It reframes cellular-resolution spike analysis as
autoregressive spatiotemporal generation,

00:00:14.059 --> 00:00:18.182
borrowing the recipe behind large language and
vision models.

00:00:18.262 --> 00:00:24.040
Trained self-supervised, it recovers circuit
connectivity and decodes mouse behavior.
